# These paths are the IAM trust anchor (bootstrap/), the reusable pipeline
# (.github/workflows/), the policy suite that gates every service repo
# (policies/), and the runtime module every stack sources (modules/) — a
# change to any of them changes what every service repo trusts, not just
# this one. Platform-team review required (DECISIONS.md §6, PRD §6.5).
/.github/workflows/   @hops-poc/platform-team
/bootstrap/            @hops-poc/platform-team
/policies/              @hops-poc/platform-team
/modules/                @hops-poc/platform-team
